#: templates/accounts/user.html:55
msgid "Deactivating takes away the key and keeps the history. Everything they recorded stays attributed to them, and can be undone by reactivating."
msgstr "Desactivar quita la llave y conserva el historial. Todo lo que registraron sigue atribuido a ellos, y se puede deshacer reactivando la cuenta."

